27429c7cb1306a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":21961942,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-09T09:01:39.387Z","creator":{"name":"CJ4","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":111056149540717,"name":"Train an NPC to fight! [1V1 UPDATE]","desc":"ZOMBIE UPDATE - INFECTION IS LIVE\n\nTRAIN AN NPC TO FIGHT\nYou don't pull the trigger - you upgrade the BRAIN. Spend cash on 14 intelligence stats and watch a clueless rookie become a genius that loots guns, takes the high ground and snipes.\n\nFOUR WORLDS\nTHE GRID - free-for-all\nTHE OFFICE - team deathmatch\nSANCTUM - capture the flag\nTHE OUTBREAK - outlive the zombie horde, or join it\n\n16 CLASSES, each with a passive and a Q ability\n19 WEAPONS - Pistol > Sniper > Flamethrower > MINIGUN\n1v1 DUELS - draw your class, climb the ranks\nCASH from kills, idle and offline\nREBIRTH for permanent multipliers plus free Cores\nOr take control of your fighter yourself\n\nHow smart can YOUR NPC get?\n\nTags: Zombie, Infection, Survival, Simulator, Auto Battler, Fighting, Idle, Upgrade, Tycoon, Arena, Gun","path":"/game/111056149540717-train-an-npc-to-fight","slug":"111056149540717-train-an-npc-to-fight","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/90cc124afe7ea5d9b400be3c1ba12f34a7798e4605a5c92450bd53eda468925a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6afc65af622248ef2b378aa728dd6a9f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":3546942,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-27T18:01:30.051Z","creator":{"name":"hello there guys","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6761209900,"name":"SUFFER","desc":"New map, more skins, more weapons and more stuff\n\nFIGHT with a range of WEAPONS and GUNS in absolute CHAOS. Use a SWORD or an AXE or a CHAINSAW or CHEETOS in COMBAT to deal PAIN. \n\nDo you want to become a STRONG WARRIOR, a true GOD? Of course you do... So you know the answer to the next question.\n\nTo suffer or to give suffering... Which will you choose?\n\nGroup: https://www.roblox.com/groups/4450727/Insomnious#!/about\n\nControls:\n- Pick-up Ragdoll: F\n- Sprint: SHIFT\n- Reload: R\n- Flip: E\n- Shiftlock: CTRL\n\nInspired by Mortem Metallum, Chaos, Pain and Combat Warriors.\n\nMastermind: Aznarog\nBuilder: Kala & Toolbox\nAdmin: SukiOxO","path":"/game/6761209900-suffer","slug":"6761209900-suffer","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6d8214598bf0da4168220f527502bf7ab4157d35bf08ac9c6af3efcbaab41f84.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1a364b4e720d6f56792244ff61a873a1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":61728096,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-31T16:56:17.619Z","creator":{"name":"Insomnious","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":138957999879593,"name":"Sky Pushers [SQUID GAME 3]","desc":"💥Welcome to Sky Pushers [SQUID GAME 3]\n\nStep onto the platforms and push your way to victory. Square, Triangle, Circle — only one will win.\n\n🏆 Last player standing wins\n⚔️ Push players off platforms\n🎯 Fight for the pole each round\n☁️ High-stakes battles in the sky\n\nCan you survive the Sky Squid Game?\n\n👍 Like & favorite the game for more!\n🔔 Follow us to get notified about updates!\n\nTags: Squid Game, Squid Game Season 3, Knives and Keys, Red Light Green Light, Jump Rope, Push, Survival","path":"/game/138957999879593-sky-pushers","slug":"138957999879593-sky-pushers","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f5844eecb1b72f240b0e44984617823098ffe5e87a25a1dd66c2a5d6a627e767.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-76c6b36bf34008f8fafcda1c61398bae/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":43811566,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-21T00:08:42.094Z","creator":{"name":"Sky Peak Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":114842743918083,"name":"Phonk Tower 🎶","desc":"🎶 Welcome to Phonk Troll Tower! 😈\n\n🌀 Climb the Tower with Phonk and unlock Gears as you go! \n🎲 Gain a new Gear every 5 minutes!\n🏆 Can you reach the top of the Troll Tower and claim the OP Gear and Admin?\n😹 Use your gear to troll others, cause mayhem, or just survive the climb!\n\n🎁 Like 👍 and Favorite ⭐ the game to unlock exclusive in-game rewards!\n🚪 Join the group to access a secret teleport zone and more surprises!\n\n✨ New Funk coming soon! 🎵","path":"/game/114842743918083-phonk-tower","slug":"114842743918083-phonk-tower","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0e09e9cd7f726319d06620e6c167e4c4385077d77a3843efa75093203d66c2da.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5ab8f4360da9de5fce6149ee23eaf624/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":40320674,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-20T22:05:16.122Z","creator":{"name":"EquipGames","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":131681811524653,"name":"Eat and Poop EVERYWHERE","desc":"🍔 Eat ALL the food. \n💩 Poop EVERYWHERE.\n🪽 Reach higher points and earn money. \n💰 Buy food multipliers to earn more.\n\nOh no... poor janitor. Toilets exist... you know?","path":"/game/131681811524653-eat-and-poop-everywhere","slug":"131681811524653-eat-and-poop-everywhere","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/20314e6b9c5ad7d64f3add901f5bf6d4188dd7997835fc10f2b1998d5c405e22.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-92a11bda26a98e076a166bd1f8d5c4af/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":2661839,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-30T05:17:41.638Z","creator":{"name":"The Coop Scoop","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":99650242193315,"name":"Trollge Incident: Another Universe [V1.02]","desc":"TI:AU, A Trollge-Genre game where you collect up to 100+ unique trolls! Fight epic-bosses! Trade with other players! Engage in PVP with other players! Open up the chests that fall out of the sky to unlock many rare item